{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W16wUDRWcUo5p7KjCcqdFN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the Apache Kafka JIRA issue that tracks the problem raised in Aditya Kousik's mailing list thread \\\\\\\"[DISCUSS] KIP-1305: Per-Record Context Processing for Kafka Consumers\\\\\\\" is:\\\\n\\\\n**KAFKA-20384**\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in:\\\\n- `/store/events/2026/03/31/jira-13646857-created-423d8790.md` (JIRA creation event)\\\\n- `/store/events/2026/03/31/mail-f25ed34b9cd1960b957fc55a-71e8fb23.md` (mailing list notification)\\\\n\\\\nThe JIRA issue, created by Aditya Kousik on March 31, 2026, has the title \\\\\\\"Per-Record Context Processing for Kafka Consumers\\\\\\\" and is classified as an Improvement affecting the clients and consumer components. Its description explicitly references \\\\\\\"See KIP-1305\\\\\\\" and describes the need for a ConsumerRecordContextProcessor to provide client-level hooks for per-record processing lifecycle events.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/12/mail-7919e736eada60fd48df146a-c191e919.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/14/mail-37f517367a9db826d7a32696-668fcb67.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/31/mail-f25ed34b9cd1960b957fc55a-71e8fb23.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/31/jira-13646857-created-423d8790.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":24.18,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":125977,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":12312,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0455907,\\\"input_tokens\\\":74,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1659}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83bef8c3-72db-4081-8448-a3681bed05b9","uuid":"dfe05e86-117d-4753-8b58-fab29ab5e918","timestamp":"2026-09-27T19:46:23.863Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the Apache Kafka JIRA issue that tracks the problem raised in Aditya Kousik's mailing list thread \